{"title":"2015 UNCO Math Contest II","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><b>2015 <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=University_of_Northern_Colorado_Math_Contest\" title=\"University of Northern Colorado Math Contest\"> UNCO Math Contest</a></b> problems and solutions. The test was held on January 31, 2015. The first link contains the full set of test problems.  The rest contain each individual problem and its solution.\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems\" title=\"2015 UNCO Math Contest II Problems\">Entire Test</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Answer_Key\" title=\"2015 UNCO Math Contest II Answer Key\">Answer Key</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2015 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2015 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2015 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2015 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2015 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2015 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2015 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 7\">Problem 7</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2015 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 8